[00:00.30]
[00:01.30]Travelling in the nights you've left me in.
[00:07.27]I feel you in the last blow of wind.
[00:13.22]Even nowhere I can find you out,
[00:18.17]The answer is not far off now.
[00:24.53]
[00:27.92]This journey of ours has been bittersweet.
[00:33.89]Close my eyes wondering what you would have dreamed.
[00:40.28]If you were here standing next to me,
[00:45.17]Would you know how I feel,
[00:48.31]And see what I see?
[00:54.53]
[00:56.96]Know that I'll always try.
[01:00.14]Finding your rhythm and rhyme.
[01:03.21]Though the nights are long and dark, I'll see you shining bright.
[01:09.06]And no matter where you are, you've come with me this far.
[01:15.15]Showing the way when all else falls apart.
[01:21.71]
[01:48.06]When the snow all melts away, and the ice finally breaks.
[01:54.14]Have you taken off, are you already on your way?
[02:00.89]No matter where you are, I've come with you this far.
[02:11.49]I'm never really lost.
[02:16.93]Our paths will surely cross.
